msgid "Parrot Bebop Autopilot"
msgstr "Parrot Bebop 飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/parrot-bebop-autopilot.rst:7
#: d8009cd897404053ab7ca9f7ecf2fac6
msgid ""
"The Parrot `Bebop2 <https://www.parrot.com/global/drones/parrot-"
"bebop-2-fpv>`__ is a Wifi controlled quadrotor UAV that uses a Linux "
"autopilot which can run ArduPilot firmware. Instructions for converting a "
"Bebop to run ArduPilot are :ref:`here <dev:building-for-bebop-2>`. We "
"recommend the Bebop2 over the original Bebop because of its much improved "
"GPS."
msgstr ""
"Parrot `Bebop2 <https://www.parrot.com/global/drones/parrot-bebop-2-fpv>`__ "
"是一款通过 Wifi 控制的四旋翼无人机，搭载运行 Linux 的飞控，可运行 ArduPilot 固件。将 Bebop 转换为运行 ArduPilot"
" 的说明请参阅 :ref:`此处 <dev:building-for-bebop-2>`。我们推荐 Bebop2 而非原版 Bebop，因为其 GPS "
"性能大幅提升。"

